  Atom pair   1 -   3 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   1 -   3 : subdivision 12, ratio  4.29101
  Atom pair   1 -   6 : subdivision 11, ratio  1.85714
  Atom pair   4 -   5 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   4 -   5 : subdivision 26, ratio  4.12821
  Atom pair   4 -   6 : 1 max / 1 min extrema; inconsistent extrema, selecting minimum closest to midpoint
  Atom pair   4 -   6 : subdivision 17, ratio  4.43478

  Checking sum of AOs overlap matrices
  (deviations may not affect overall accuracy of MOs)

